  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n<div>Zoom in on the map above and click your area of interest to determine which PDF(s) you require for download.<br /></div><div><br /></div><div>These maps are available for the Far North Land Use Planning Area at 2 scales (1:100,000 and 1:250,000). The maps were created as a resource for community-based Land Use Planning in the Far North of Ontario.</div><div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div><ul>\n\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/FarNorthHydrologyAndElevationMapsDataPackagesExtentAndHistory.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Index map with 100K and 250K tiles, secondary watersheds and Far North Communities (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/FarNorthHydrologyAndElevationMapsUserGuide.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>GeoPDF User Guide (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\n</ul></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Completed: Production of the data has been completed<br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Not planned: There are no plans to update the data<br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - GeospatialOntario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca</a></div></span>"
